+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
+---------------+-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: profit.nation ASC NULLS LAST, profit.o_year DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: profit.nation, profit.o_year, sum(profit.amount) AS sum_profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[profit.nation, profit.o_year]], aggr=[[sum(profit.amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: profit                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |         Projection: nation.n_name AS nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), orders.o_orderdate) AS o_year, lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Decimal128(1,20,0) - lineitem.l_discount) - partsupp.ps_supplycost * lineitem.l_quantity AS amount                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |           Inner Join: lineitem.l_orderkey = orders.o_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             Projection: partsupp.ps_supplycost, lineitem.l_discount, lineitem.l_extendedprice, lineitem.l_orderkey, lineitem.l_quantity, nation.n_name                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |               Inner Join: supplier.s_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                 Projection: partsupp.ps_supplycost, lineitem.l_discount, lineitem.l_extendedprice, lineitem.l_orderkey, lineitem.l_quantity, supplier.s_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                   Inner Join: lineitem.l_suppkey = supplier.s_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                     Projection: partsupp.ps_supplycost, lineitem.l_discount, lineitem.l_extendedprice, lineitem.l_orderkey, lineitem.l_quantity, lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                       Inner Join: partsupp.ps_suppkey = lineitem.l_suppkey, partsupp.ps_partkey = lineitem.l_partkey, part.p_partkey = lineitem.l_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                         Inner Join: part.p_partkey = partsupp.ps_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                           Projection: part.p_partkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                             Filter: part.p_name LIKE Utf8("%green%")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                               TableScan: part projection=[p_name, p_partkey], partial_filters=[part.p_name LIKE Utf8("%green%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                           TableScan: partsupp projection=[ps_partkey, ps_suppkey, ps_supplycost]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                         TableScan: lineitem projection=[l_discount, l_extendedprice, l_orderkey, l_partkey, l_quantity, l_suppkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                     TableScan: supplier projection=[s_nationkey, s_suppkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                 TableScan: nation projection=[n_name, n_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |             TableScan: orders projection=[o_orderdate, o_orderkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [nation@0 ASC NULLS LAST, o_year@1 DESC]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[nation@0 as nation, o_year@1 as o_year, sum(profit.amount)@2 as sum_profit]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     SortExec: expr=[nation@0 ASC NULLS LAST, o_year@1 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[nation@0 as nation, o_year@1 as o_year], aggr=[sum(profit.amount)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
