|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[n_name@5 as nation, date_part(YEAR, o_orderdate@6) as o_year, l_extendedprice@2 * (1 - l_discount@1) - ps_supplycost@0 * l_quantity@4 as amount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(l_orderkey@3, o_orderkey@1)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
