|               |                                 HashJoinExec: mode=Partitioned, join_type=Inner, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(ps_suppkey@2, l_suppkey@5), (ps_partkey@1, l_partkey@3), (p_partkey@0, l_partkey@3)]                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
